  "scope": "The absolute plan positions at roof height vary between acquisitions, especially across the street. Each view independently places the two readable front fold edges meeting about 3 m behind the eaves and 4.5–5.1 m in from the lane. The two painted elevations fix the eaves; aerial measurements fix the approximate extent but do not determine pitch, tile courses, or rear ridge profiles. The present model clips the roof at Y7.1. No aerial image pixels are embedded."
